Package: bcyieldcurves
Type: Package
Title: Process BC Forest Inventory Data and Generate Yield Curves via VDYP7
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Derek", "Sattler", , "derek.sattler@nrcan-rncan.gc.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for processing British Columbia's Vegetation Resources Inventory (VRI) 
    data and generating forest yield curves. The package provides functions to subset VRI data,
    match polygons to existing managed stand yield curves, identify records requiring VDYP7 
    processing, and execute the complete VDYP7 workflow including parameter file creation,
    execution, and post-processing of results.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/dfelixsattler/bcVDYPMSYTyieldcurves
BugReports: https://github.com/dfelixsattler/bcVDYPMSYTyieldcurves/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
